    "exact_onset_frame": 8,
    "exact_vs_smooth": "E_minus and J_NEC are the EXACT objectives, integrals of max(0, -rho) and max(0, -N_min). The softplus columns are a smooth surrogate for a future gradient-based optimizer; softplus systematically overestimates max(0,x) near zero, which is exactly where certification happens, so it is never substituted for the exact value.",
